# Signal Chain Page — Production Handoff

**Route:** `/signal-chain`  
**Page file:** `frontend/src/pages/SignalChain.tsx` (3-line wrapper)  
**All logic:** `frontend/src/components/signal-chain/SignalChainView.tsx` (615 lines, all co-located)  
**Last updated:** 2026-05-23

---

## Architecture

One file. All 7 sub-components co-located. No separate files per step.

```
SignalChainView (main export)
├── ReconciledVerdictBar   — final decision + WAR_VETO warning + reconciliation reasons
├── HistoryStrip           — Δ vs prev snapshot (SPY/COT/score/verdict)
├── RawInputsStrip         — all live numbers with ⓘ tooltips (14 cells)
├── ScorerPillars          — primary row (5) + secondary row (5) + PillarCard components
├── KillChainGate          — 5 layers + macro, click-to-expand
├── ReconciliationEngine   — divergence scorer vs kill chain → reconciled
└── TrainButton            — JSONL snapshot append for fine-tuning
```

**Data source:** `GET /kill-shots-live` (30s poll)  
**History source:** `GET /api/snapshots?limit=2` (on mount only)  
**Training endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/training/snapshot`

