## API Base URL Pattern

```ts
const API = (import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:8000/api/v1').replace('/api/v1', '');
// API = base URL without /api/v1
// Usage: fetch(`${API}/kill-shots-live`)         → correct
// Usage: fetch(`${API}/api/v1/training/snapshot`) → correct
// NEVER: fetch(`${API}/api/v1/api/v1/...`)        → double prefix bug
```

