## Kill Chain Gate — 5 Layers

| Layer | Name | Trigger condition |
|-------|------|-------------------|
| layer_1 | COT Extreme | specs_net < -100K |
| layer_2 | GEX Negative | gex_regime = NEGATIVE |
| layer_3 | DVR Distribution | sv_pct > threshold |
| layer_4 | AXLFI Call Wall | SPY above call wall |
| layer_5 | QQQ Reshort | qqq_sv_delta > 10pp + above wall |
| layer_macro | Macro / WAR | war_status ≥ 7 |

Confluence levels: WAITING (0) → SINGLE (1) → DOUBLE (2) → TRIPLE (3) → QUAD (4+)

