## History Strip

Fetches `GET /api/snapshots?limit=2`. Returns `{ snapshots: SnapRow[] }`.

Fields used: `captured_at`, `spy_price`, `cot_net`, `score`, `verdict`.

If fewer than 2 snapshots exist, strip renders null (no error shown).

